  "talents_description": {
    "modifier_jakiro_1_0": "Strength, Intellect: 4/8",
    "modifier_jakiro_1_1": "Strength, Intellect: <b><font color='#eabe10'>4</font></b>/8",
    "modifier_jakiro_1_2": "Strength, Intellect: 4/<b><font color='#eabe10'>8</font></b>",
    "modifier_jakiro_2_0": "<b><font color='#ff0000'> Removes Ice Path. </font></b> \n\n New Active Ability: Fire Gush \n\n Summons a fiery stream that deals magic damage to enemies and increases the damage they take. Affects all enemies in its path. \n\n Wave Radius: 260 \n Wave Range: 1200 \n Damage: 100 + 100%/200% of Strength \n Increased Damage to Enemies: 15% \n Effect Duration: 4 sec. \n Mana Cost: 50 \n Cooldown: 9 sec.",
    "modifier_jakiro_2_1": "<b><font color='#ff0000'> Removes Ice Path. </font></b> \n\n New Active Ability: <b><font color='#eabe10'>Fire Gush</font></b> \n\n Summons a fiery stream that deals magic damage to enemies and increases the damage they take. Affects all enemies in its path. \n\n Wave Radius: 260 \n Wave Range: 1200 \n Damage: <b><font color='#eabe10'>100</font></b> + <b><font color='#eabe10'>100%</font></b>/200% of Strength \n Increased Damage to Enemies: <b><font color='#eabe10'>15%</font></b> \n Effect Duration: 4 sec. \n Mana Cost: 50 \n Cooldown: 9 sec.",
    "modifier_jakiro_2_2": "<b><font color='#ff0000'> Removes Ice Path. </font></b> \n\n New Active Ability: <b><font color='#eabe10'>Fire Gush</font></b> \n\n Summons a fiery stream that deals magic damage to enemies and increases the damage they take. Affects all enemies in its path. \n\n Wave Radius: 260 \n Wave Range: 1200 \n Damage: <b><font color='#eabe10'>100</font></b> + 100%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>200%</font></b> of Strength \n Increased Damage to Enemies: <b><font color='#eabe10'>15%</font></b> \n Effect Duration: 4 sec. \n Mana Cost: 50 \n Cooldown: 9 sec.",
    "modifier_jakiro_3_0": "Dual Breath Cooldown Reduction: 1/2/3 sec.",
    "modifier_jakiro_3_1": "Dual Breath Cooldown Reduction: <b><font color='#eabe10'>1</font></b>/2/3 sec.",
    "modifier_jakiro_3_2": "Dual Breath Cooldown Reduction: 1/<b><font color='#eabe10'>2</font></b>/3 sec.",
    "modifier_jakiro_3_3": "Dual Breath Cooldown Reduction: 1/2/<b><font color='#eabe10'>3</font></b> sec.",
    "modifier_jakiro_4_0": "Dual Breath does not require Mana. \n\n Fire Dual Breath knocks back enemies: 400",
    "modifier_jakiro_4_1": "Dual Breath does not require Mana. \n\n Fire Dual Breath knocks back enemies: <b><font color='#eabe10'>400</font></b>",
    "modifier_jakiro_5_0": "Macropyre Cooldown Decreases: 19/38/57 sec.",
    "modifier_jakiro_5_1": "Macropyre Cooldown Decreases: <b><font color='#eabe10'>19</font></b>/38/57 sec.",
    "modifier_jakiro_5_2": "Macropyre Cooldown Decreases: 19/<b><font color='#eabe10'>38</font></b>/57 sec.",
    "modifier_jakiro_5_3": "Macropyre Cooldown Decreases: 19/38/<b><font color='#eabe10'>57</font></b> sec.",
    "modifier_jakiro_6_0": "Grants Unobstructed Vision: 400/800 \n\n Allows walking through trees and Increases Movement Speed: 7%/14%",
    "modifier_jakiro_6_1": "Grants Unobstructed Vision: <b><font color='#eabe10'>400</font></b>/800 \n\n Allows walking through trees and Increases Movement Speed: <b><font color='#eabe10'>7%</font></b>/14%",
    "modifier_jakiro_6_2": "Grants Unobstructed Vision: 400/<b><font color='#eabe10'>800</font></b> \n\n Allows walking through trees and Increases Movement Speed: 7%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>14%</font></b>",
    "modifier_jakiro_7_0": "Lava walls appear on the sides of Macropyre's line of fire, blocking movement. \n\n Macropyre deals Pure Damage. \n\n Spell Damage: 30%",
    "modifier_jakiro_7_1": "Lava walls appear on the sides of Macropyre's line of fire, blocking movement. \n\n Macropyre deals <b><font color='#eabe10'>Pure</font></b> Damage. \n\n Spell Damage: <b><font color='#eabe10'>30%</font></b>",
    "modifier_jakiro_8_0": "Increases Liquid Fire burn damage: 12/24",
