    "modifier_jakiro_16_0": "<b><font color='#ff0000'> Removes Macropyre. </font></b> \n\n New Active Ability: Ice Embrace \n\n Encases himself in an icy cocoon, regenerating a percentage of his maximum health and mana every second. The cocoon completely blocks all physical damage. \n\n Duration: 4 sec. \n Max Health Regeneration: 2%/3% \n Max Mana Reneration: 2%/3% \n Cooldown: 15 sec.",
    "modifier_jakiro_16_1": "<b><font color='#ff0000'> Removes Macropyre. </font></b> \n\n New Active Ability: <b><font color='#eabe10'>Ice Embrace</font></b> \n\n Encases himself in an icy cocoon, regenerating a percentage of his maximum health and mana every second. The cocoon completely blocks all physical damage. \n\n Duration: 4 sec. \n Max Health Regeneration: <b><font color='#eabe10'>2%</font></b>/3% \n Max Mana Reneration: <b><font color='#eabe10'>2%</font></b>/3% \n Cooldown: 15 sec.",
    "modifier_jakiro_16_2": "<b><font color='#ff0000'> Removes Macropyre. </font></b> \n\n New Active Ability: <b><font color='#eabe10'>Ice Embrace</font></b> \n\n Encases himself in an icy cocoon, regenerating a percentage of his maximum health and mana every second. The cocoon completely blocks all physical damage. \n\n Duration: 4 sec. \n Max Health Regeneration: 2%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>3%</font></b> \n Max Mana Reneration: 2%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>3%</font></b> \n Cooldown: 15 sec.",
    "modifier_jakiro_17_0": "Ice Embrace allows you to turn, use Abilities, and use Items. \n\n Increased Spell Damage during Ice Embrace: 0%/10%/20%",
    "modifier_jakiro_17_1": "Ice Embrace allows you to turn, use Abilities, and use Items. \n\n Increased Spell Damage during Ice Embrace: <b><font color='#eabe10'>0%</font></b>/10%/20%",
    "modifier_jakiro_17_2": "Ice Embrace allows you to turn, use Abilities, and use Items. \n\n Increased Spell Damage during Ice Embrace: 0%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>10%</font></b>/20%",
    "modifier_jakiro_17_3": "Ice Embrace allows you to turn, use Abilities, and use Items. \n\n Increased Spell Damage during Ice Embrace: 0%/10%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>20%</font></b>",
    "modifier_jakiro_18_0": "Dual Breath is cast instantly. \n\n Ice Dual Breath applies numbness: 1/2 sec.",
    "modifier_jakiro_18_1": "Dual Breath is cast instantly. \n\n Ice Dual Breath applies numbness: <b><font color='#eabe10'>1</font></b>/2 sec.",
    "modifier_jakiro_18_2": "Dual Breath is cast instantly. \n\n Ice Dual Breath applies numbness: 1/<b><font color='#eabe10'>2</font></b> sec.",
    "modifier_jakiro_19_0": "Increased Ice Path Duration: 1/2/3 sec \n\n Ice Path reduces Enemy Health Restoration: 10%/20%/30%",
    "modifier_jakiro_19_1": "Increased Ice Path Duration: <b><font color='#eabe10'>1</font></b>/2/3 sec \n\n Ice Path reduces Enemy Health Restoration: <b><font color='#eabe10'>10%</font></b>/20%/30%",
    "modifier_jakiro_19_2": "Increased Ice Path Duration: 1/<b><font color='#eabe10'>2</font></b>/3 sec \n\n Ice Path reduces Enemy Health Restoration: 10%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>20%</font></b>/30%",
    "modifier_jakiro_19_3": "Increased Ice Path Duration: 1/2/<b><font color='#eabe10'>3</font></b> sec \n\n Ice Path reduces Enemy Health Restoration: 10%/20%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>30%</font></b>",
