    "modifier_jakiro_21_0": "<b><font color='#ff0000'> Increases Ice Path Cooldown: 1 sec. </font></b> \n\n Ice Path is cast instantly. \n\n Ice Path moves the hero to the target point, granting status immunity and 65% magic resistance during the travel.",
